  "name": "Robot Goal Review",
  "description": "Reads Robot Status in one scheduled pass, uses an LLM to decide whether the current goal is complete or needs one high-level next instruction, saves that decision, optionally delegates the instruction to Robot Autonomy Executor, and ends.",
