    {"id":"policy","type":"inputNode","position":{"x":310,"y":-130},"data":{"label":"Goal Review Task","nodeType":"text_input","properties":{"message":"Review the current Robot Status task as one independent decision. Decide from the recorded objective, the latest action result, current environment facts, recent conversation, and persona whether the objective is complete, should wait, needs user input, or needs one further attempt. If and only if another attempt is useful, write one high-level nextInstruction describing the needed effect; do not select a command or create a movement plan because Robot Autonomy Executor owns that choice. Do not repeat an action merely because it appears in history. Do not invent completion or current physical facts. response is optional and must be empty unless one concise sentence is useful. Return only the requested JSON.","inputKey":""}}},
